title: "OPFF Audit Charter & Forensic Verdict Ledger: Byte-Level Zero-Truncation Audit of Frontier Mathematical Corpora"
abstract: "Byte-level zero-truncation forensic audit of frontier AI and classical mathematical formal verification corpora (15 deep-dive cases, 892 standalone Lean 4 theorems with 0 sorry and 0 axiom, 4,191/4,191 hypothesis mutations killed, auditing 48,603 upstream .lean files across 12.4M+ lines) executed under the 5-Gate Joint International Audit Rubric unifying COPE, IMU/AMS/EMS, ACM Artifact Review v1.1, ICMJE/NISO CRediT, and NeurIPS/ICML/ICLR reproducibility standards."
